</xref>).</p><table-wrap position="float" id="T4"><label>Table&#x000a0;4</label><caption><p>Genotypic association tests performed considering each SNP alone for the number of retrieved oocytes.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Model</th><th valign="middle" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Genotype</th><th valign="middle" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
